    void Help(){Clear("help");Heading("Field manual","YOUR BASE KIT IS ALWAYS FREE.");Text("MOVE / A D walk. W jump. S crouch. Double-tap to dash.\nGUARD / Hold away. Down-away blocks lows. No air block.\nPARRY / Tap toward for high/air attacks, down for lows.\nATTACK / U I O = light, medium, heavy punches. J K L = kicks.\nTHROW / LP + LK. OVERHEAD / MP + MK. PP / P. KK / semicolon.\nMOTIONS / QCF = down, down-toward, toward. DP = toward, down, down-toward.\nCHARGE / Hold away or down for 45 ticks, then opposite + attack.\nEX / Finish a special motion with two punches or kicks.\nSUPER / Double QCF + required attack. See the move list.",58,177,22,Cream,1160);Text("THE ECONOMY\nStart with 600 CR. EX spends 300 on startup; supers spend 900 / 1200 / 1500.\nWin: +1200. Loss: +900 / 1200 / 1500 by recovery tier. Draw: +900. Cap: 3600.\nShop techniques and paid moves share one wallet. Combat never earns credits.\nLeases last one round. Your reserve prevents spending below a chosen floor.",58,459,20,Gold,1160);Back();Button("Move list →",948,648,278,()=>MoveList(0));}
